Board of Directors Leadership Structure

As a general policy, our Board of Directors believes that separation of the positions of Chairperson and Chief Executive Officer reinforces the independence of our Board of Directors from management, creates an environment that encourages objective oversight of management’s performance and enhances the effectiveness of our Board of Directors as a whole. As such, Mr. Iwicki serves as our Chief Executive Officer and Mr. Munshi serves as the Chairperson of our Board of Directors.

